4. test_reading_a_delivery_man_with_an_empty_ref_code_does_not_write_from_the_accessor —
   green-but-blind trap guard: confirms the accessor is a PURE passthrough (asserts empty,
   not non-empty) so a "read still writes for empty case" regression can't hide behind a
   coincidentally-passing assertion shape.

